<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Ashwagandha - Plant Tag</title>
    <style>
        :root { 
            --primary-color: #2c5e43; 
            --text-dark: #333333; 
            --text-muted: #666666; 
            --bg-card: #ffffff; 
            --border-color: #e0e0e0; 
        }
        body { 
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; 
            background-color: #f5f5f5; 
            display: flex; 
            flex-direction: column; 
            align-items: center; 
            justify-content: center; 
            min-height: 100vh; 
            margin: 0; 
            padding: 20px; 
        }
        .back-btn { 
            margin-bottom: 20px; 
            color: var(--primary-color); 
            text-decoration: none; 
            font-size: 0.9rem; 
            font-weight: bold; 
        }
        .plant-tag { 
            background-color: var(--bg-card); 
            width: 320px; 
            padding: 24px; 
            border-radius: 8px; 
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); 
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color); 
            position: relative; 
            box-sizing: border-box; 
        }
        .plant-tag::before { 
            content: ''; 
            position: absolute; 
            top: 20px; 
            left: 20px; 
            width: 12px; 
            height: 12px; 
            background-color: #f5f5f5; 
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color); 
            border-radius: 50%; 
        }
        .header { 
            text-align: right; 
            margin-bottom: 16px; 
        }
        .badge { 
            font-size: 0.75rem; 
            letter-spacing: 0.15em; 
            text-transform: uppercase; 
            font-weight: 700; 
            color: #7f8c8d; 
            display: block; 
            line-height: 1.2; 
        }
        .badge.primary { 
            color: var(--primary-color); 
            font-size: 0.85rem; 
        }
        .title-section { 
            margin-bottom: 20px; 
            padding-left: 20px; 
        }
        .main-title { 
            font-family: "Georgia", serif; 
            color: var(--primary-color); 
            font-size: 2rem; 
            font-weight: 400; 
            margin: 0; 
            line-height: 1.1; 
        }
        .botanical-name { 
            font-size: 0.95rem; 
            color: var(--text-muted); 
            margin: 4px 0 0 0; 
        }
        .botanical-name em { 
            font-style: italic; 
            font-weight: 600; 
        }
        .info-block { 
            margin-bottom: 16px; 
            font-size: 0.85rem; 
            line-height: 1.45; 
            color: var(--text-dark); 
        }
        .info-heading {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .tag-icon {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }
        .divider { 
            border: 0; 
            border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-color); 
            margin: 16px 0; 
        }
        .footer { 
            font-size: 0.65rem; 
            font-style: italic; 
            color: #999999; 
            text-align: center; 
            margin-top: 24px; 
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <a href="database.html" class="back-btn">← Back to Database</a>

    <article class="plant-tag">
        <header class="header">
            <span class="badge primary">Medicinal /</span>
            <span class="badge">Root Shrub</span>
        </header>

        <div class="title-section">
            <h1 class="main-title">Ashwagandha</h1>
            <p class="botanical-name"><em>Withania somnifera</em> - Indian Ginseng / Winter Cherry</p>
        </div>

        <hr class="divider">

        <div class="info-block">
            <div class="info-heading">
                <span class="tag-icon">☀️</span>
                <span>Full Sun</span>
            </div>
            <strong>Description:</strong> A compact, stout perennial sub-shrub covered in fine velvety hairs. It produces small, inconspicuous greenish-yellow flowers followed by bright red berries encased in paper-like calyxes. Its fleshy, tuberous roots are globally celebrated as a premier adaptogen for stress and vitality support.
        </div>

        <div class="info-block">
            <strong>Maturity:</strong> Ready for root harvesting roughly 150 to 180 days (5 to 6 months) after sowing, usually when the leaves begin to dry out and the berries ripen to a bold red.
        </div>

        <div class="info-block">
            <strong>Suggested Pollinators:</strong> Mostly self-pollinating, though small bees and insects occasionally visit its small bell-shaped blooms.
        </div>

        <hr class="divider">

        <div class="info-block">
            <div class="info-heading">
                <span class="tag-icon">🪴</span>
                <span>Dry, Sandy, Sharply Well Drained Soil</span>
            </div>
            <strong>Shrub Care:</strong> Native to arid regions, it demands light, sandy, or gravelly soils with a slightly alkaline pH. Requires very minimal water; standing moisture or overwatering is fatal and quickly results in root decay. Avoid high-nitrogen fertilizers to prioritize potent root development over leafy overgrowth. Keep safe from frost.
        </div>

        <div class="info-block">
            <div class="info-heading">
                <span class="tag-icon">📏</span>
                <span>Height to 60CM - 1.5M</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer class="footer">
            Picture and information intended only as a helpful guide.
        </footer>
    </article>

</body>
</html>
